## Restore commands

This session:

```bash
cd ~/Code/joelhooks/pi-bellwether && pi --session ~/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-joel-Code-joelhooks-pi-bellwether--/2026-09-23T16-54-07-523Z_01a0cf30-59a3-7224-8fe5-26bf174f82ad.jsonl
```

drovr desk, which needs its environment variable and extension. A plain `pi --session` restore silently loses the desk-queue digest:

```bash
cd ~/Code/badass-courses/drovr && HERDR_DESK_PROJECT=drovr pi -e ~/Code/joelhooks/dark-wizard/herdr/desk/desk-queue.ts --model claude-bridge/claude-opus-5-5 --thinking high --session ~/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-joel-Code-badass-courses-drovr--/2026-09-25T17-02-15-478Z_01a0d984-83b6-7346-8ff2-c18f28b248be.jsonl
```

If Herdr restores the desk pane automatically, quit it and relaunch with the command above in the same `💬 desk` tab of the drovr space.

